hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2903","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Maymun in Alexandria, who said: Narrated to us Al-Walid, on the authority of Al-Awza'i, on the authority of Yahya, on the authority of Abu Salamah, on the authority of Abu Hurairah (RA), who said: \"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) sacrificed a cow on behalf of the women who performed 'Umrah during the Farewell Pilgrimage, and they shared in it.\""
